tpm 1
boot power
# attract: power-on with blank cards and no input, through two rounds of the attract loop.
# TITLE's 1,800 idle frames start a how-to-play demo (HOW_N, then HOW_VS the next time; neither
# is traced), which goes on to RANKING; RANKING goes to TIT_DEMO and the story to TITLE again.
# The RANKING segments start with what each demo leaves: next program, phase, counter, seed.
program SW_ON
program TIT_DEMO
program TITLE
program RANKING
program TIT_DEMO
program TITLE
program RANKING
program TIT_DEMO
